{"@context":["https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/ns/content/v1.jsonld",{"@base":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio/"}],"@id":"papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/prf-lambda-scale-substrate-form","@type":["folio-assistant-core:Proof","doco:Section"],"label":"prf:lambda-scale-substrate-form","kind":"proof","title":"Proof of lambda scale substrate form","uses":["papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/prop-lambda-scale-substrate-form"],"text":"lambda-scale-substrate-form-proof.md","provenance":"authored","html":"<a id=\"prf:lambda-scale-substrate-form\"></a><p><strong>Proof.</strong> <em>Direct computation. The quantum dimensions at <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">H_4</code> are\n<code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\dim_q V_{(4)} = 1</code>, <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\dim_q V_{(3,1)} = [3]_q</code>, <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\dim_q V_{(2,2)} = [4]_q/[2]_q</code>,\n<code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\dim_q V_{(2,1,1)} = [3]_q</code>, <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\dim_q V_{(1,1,1,1)} = 1</code>; their sum is\n<code class=\"language-math math-inline\">3q^2 + 4 + 3q^{-2}</code> (verified symbolically). Division by 4 and substitution\n<code class=\"language-math math-inline\">h = q - q^{-1}</code> yields the form via <code>field_simp; ring</code>.</em> <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\square</code></p>\n","source":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/lambda-scale-substrate-form-proof.md","heading":"Proof"}
